  "description": "R-PAR-1 PAR-ERROR, SQL-DEMAND: After the error at id 100 of SELECT id, 1 / zm AS e FROM ER: is it raised again when the row is read twice, after MovePrevious from id 101, after MoveFirst and Move(98) back to id 99 and forward again, and does Move(149) past it (to id 150) read normally; asked for a snapshot and a dynaset (Fields id and e read at each position). Runs on a fresh copy of r-par-1-error opened read-only through DAO OpenDatabase in one process and one STA; each statement is opened with Database.OpenRecordset as a snapshot unless stated, and every call's result, HRESULT and DBEngine.Errors are captured.",
